@* Hộp thoại xác nhận dạng lớp phủ; focus mặc định vào nút an toàn (không thực hiện). *@
<div class="dialog-backdrop">
    <div class="dialog" role="alertdialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dialog-title" aria-describedby="dialog-message">
        <h2 id="dialog-title" class="dialog-title">@Title</h2>
        <p id="dialog-message" class="dialog-message">@Message</p>
        <div class="dialog-actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" @ref="_safeButton" @onclick="OnCancel">@CancelText</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" @onclick="OnConfirm">@ConfirmText</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    private ElementReference _safeButton;

    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Title { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Parameter]
    public string? Message { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public string ConfirmText { get; set; } = "Đồng ý";

    [Parameter]
    public string CancelText { get; set; } = "Quay lại";

    [Parameter]
    public EventCallback OnConfirm { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public EventCallback OnCancel { get; set; }

    protected override async Task OnAfterRenderAsync(bool firstRender)
    {
        if (firstRender)
        {
            await _safeButton.FocusAsync();
        }
    }
}
